    "detailed_description": "A colorful physics game about caring for your friends.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1484600/extras/e5b20644117ba4bd4ca18012b26024f8.poster.avif?t=1736558795\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1484600/extras/e5b20644117ba4bd4ca18012b26024f8.webm?t=1736558795\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1484600/extras/e5b20644117ba4bd4ca18012b26024f8.mp4?t=1736558795\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1484600/extras/23d8b81520b509ce0888b53e3db9bfc5.webp?t=1736558795\" /></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1484600/extras/51e7405f8c6731ecefe1a9df286da338.webp?t=1736558795\" /></div><br><br>In Stand By Me, play as the curious and adventurous Pico as he travels through a fantastic and ever-changing geometric land with the aid of its many magnetic denizens \u2013 and help him find at long last what he's searching for.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1484600/extras/ff049dfbb91f1019c00d44240670e69b.poster.avif?t=1736558795\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1484600/extras/ff049dfbb91f1019c00d44240670e69b.webm?t=1736558795\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1484600/extras/ff049dfbb91f1019c00d44240670e69b.mp4?t=1736558795\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1484600/extras/23d8b81520b509ce0888b53e3db9bfc5.webp?t=1736558795\" /></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1484600/extras/e7e29db6e88d766adc246d7f4f3a9d3d.webp?t=1736558795\" /></div><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Over <strong>100 unique stages</strong> across <strong>seven books</strong>;<br></li><li> Over a dozen different <strong>magnets and stage elements</strong> to interact with;<br></li><li> A dynamic <strong>picture-book-themed story</strong>;<br></li><li> All original <strong>groovy soundtrack</strong> (and sound effects);<br></li><li> An <strong>in-game timer</strong> for tracking your run times;<br></li><li> <strong>Five unlockable player skills</strong> that greatly change gameplay;<br></li><li> <strong>Make-a-Friend</strong>: customize your own friends!<br></li><li> Assorted hats.</li></ul>",
